        "TileImage": "$($repository 9030fd61-b671-47cc-86f5-b7bb38fffc3a).Image",
        "Description": "误入歧途 The Dead End\r关卡目标：\r*身着西装，杀死雅各布·阿尔宾以获取你下一步的服装\r*身着宫殿员工的服装，用螺丝刀杀死赫尔穆特·克鲁格并获取你下一步的服装\r*身着克鲁格的服装，掰断罗兰德·兰德里的脖子\r*身着克鲁格的服装，将狄迪尔·丹尼斯用注射毒药杀死\rThe targets:\r*Eliminate Jacob Arbin in your suit to retrieve the disguise you need\r*Eliminate Helmut Kruger with screwdriver when you disguise as palace staff,and retrieve the disguise you need\r*Eliminate Roland Landry by breaking his neck when you disguise as Helmut Kruger\r*Eliminate Didier Dennis by injected poison when you disguise as Helmut Kruger",
        "GameVersion": "8.23.0.0",
